Name:Rules pilot 369 - Mentor needs a smaller student
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:It is your first main phase. You control Sunhome Stalwart (2/2 first strike, mentor) and Memnite (1/1), and have Giant Growth in hand with one green mana floating. The opponent is at 7 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-mentor-lesser-power | Mentor puts a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power (CR 702.134a): the floating green must be spent now, so Giant Growth goes on the Stalwart (5/5), which mentors Memnite to 2/2 for 7; Giant Growth on Memnite makes it 4/4, too big to mentor, and the total is 6
